Oh my god you have to see this — I just wrapped up 5,000 stress cycles on the watchdog module and it passed EVERY SINGLE ONE 🎉🔥 Here's the core loop:

```c
void watchdog_task(void *arg) {
    uint32_t last_health = get_latest_health_timestamp();
    while (1) {
        uint32_t now = get_timestamp_ms();
        uint32_t elapsed = now - last_health;
        if (elapsed > WATCHDOG_TIMEOUT_MS) {
            pet_hardware_watchdog();
            continue;
        }
        if (elapsed > ADAPTIVE_FALLBACK_TIMEOUT_MS) {
            pet_hardware_watchdog();
            telemetry_drop_frame();
            continue;
        }
        pet_hardware_watchdog();
        telemetry_send_frame(get_health_packet());
        vTaskDelay(pdMS_TO_TICKS(100));
    }
}
```

